#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (PreventEmptyClipboard), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:18
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be "
"emptied. E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be "
"emptied."
msgstr ""
"Wenn disse Optschoon anmaakt is, warrt de Twischenaflaag nich leddig maakt. "
"Normalerwies warrt se t.B. leddig maakt, wenn en Programm beendt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (IgnoreSelection), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:25
msgid "Ignore Selection"
msgstr "Köör övergahn"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (IgnoreSelection), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:27
msgid ""
"<qt>When an area of the screen is selected with mouse or keyboard, this is "
"called \"the selection\".<br/>"
"If this option is set, the selection is not entered into the clipboard "
"history, though it is still available for pasting using the middle mouse "
"button.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Is en Schirmrebeet mit de Muus oder Tastatuur markeert, warrt dit <em>"
"\"Köör\"</em> nöömt.<br/>"
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt de Köör nich na de Twischenaflaag-Vörgeschicht "
"opnahmen, ok wenn se sik liekers mit den Middel-Muusknoop infögen lett. </qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SyncClipboards), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:34
msgid "Synchronize clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Twischenaflaag un Köör synkroniseren"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SyncClipboards), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:36
msgid ""
"<qt>When an area of the screen is selected with mouse or keyboard, this is "
"called \"the selection\".<br/>"
"If this option is selected, the selection and the clipboard is kept the same, "
"so that anything in the selection is immediately available for pasting "
"elsewhere using any method, including the traditional middle mouse button. "
"Otherwise, the selection is recorded in the clipboard history, but the "
"selection can only be pasted using the middle mouse button. Also see the "
"'Ignore Selection' option.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Is en Schirmrebeet mit de Muus oder Tastatuur markeert, warrt dit <em>"
"\"Köör\"</em> nöömt.<br/>"
"Is dit anmaakt, sünd Köör un Twischenaflaag dat sülve. Allens binnen de Köör "
"steiht fuurts överall för't Infögen mit jichtenseen Metood praat, ok mit den "
"Middel-Muusknoop. Anners warrt de Köör na de Twischenaflaag-Vörgeschicht "
"opnahmen, man lett sik bloots mit den Middel-Muusknoop infögen. Kiek ok bi de "
"Optschoon \"Köör övergahn\".</qt>"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (SelectionTextOnly), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:39
msgid "Selection text only"
msgstr "Bloots köört Text"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (SelectionTextOnly), group (General)
#. +> future stable fustable
#: klipper.kcfg:41
msgid ""
"<qt>When an area of the screen is selected with mouse or keyboard, this is "
"called \"the selection\".<br/>"
"If this option is selected, only text selections are stored in the history, "
"while images and other selections are not.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Is en Schirmrebeet mit de Muus oder Tastatuur markeert, warrt dit "
"\"Köör\" nöömt.<br/>"
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt in de Vörgeschicht bloots Textkören, man keen Biller "
"oder anner Kören sekert.</qt>"

